<main class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 pb-16 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:py-20">
    <section><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#F0C13A] bg-[#FDE68A] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#624300] dark:border-[#F5B316]/35 dark:bg-[#F5B316]/20 dark:text-[#FCD34D]"><i data-lucide="landmark"></i>Sistem Digital Pengelolaan BUMDes</span><h1 class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Keuangan BUMDes yang tertata, layanan warga yang mudah diakses.</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#6B665C] dark:text-[#9E988A]">Bumcash membantu pengelola mencatat transaksi per Unit Usaha, memantau tagihan layanan, serta menyusun laporan pertanggungjawaban dalam satu sistem.</p><a href="{{ route('login') }}" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#E09F09] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A1302] hover:bg-[#C78A05]"><i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>Masuk ke Bumcash</a></section>
